This is the folder for Tracking THoR, all code that is needed for this project can be found in this folder.
The goal of the Tracking THoR project was to create a rating system to players using tracking data.
The data will not be shared at the request of SportLogiq. The files need to be run in the following order.

TrackingTHoRStintsWide.R
TrackingTHoREventToGoalTimes.R
TrackingTHoRDataframesCreation.R
TrackingTHoR12SecondModels3Players.R
TrackingTHoRRAPMModels.R
TrackingTHoR_DWRAPMModels.R
TrackingTHoRDWRAPMCheck.R
TrackingTHoRRAPMForCompare.R
